#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0053 expect=violation domain=TA
#note "Second in-scope domain: pins that Scope.Domains.Include: [DM, TA] really reaches TA. Row 1 has ARMCD='NOTASSGN' but ARM='ScreenFailure', not 'Not Assigned' -> fires. ARM value is deliberately space-free here so the pin needs no quoting."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 ARMCD=NOTASSGN ARM=ScreenFailure
dataset TA
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col ARMCD   type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
col TAETORD type=Num
col ETCD    type=Char
col ELEMENT type=Char
---
S1 | TA | NOTASSGN | ScreenFailure | 1 | SCRN | Screening
S1 | TA | A        | Placebo       | 1 | SCRN | Screening
